#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:630
msgid "Does Sekkei require Elementor Pro?"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:634
msgid "No. Sekkei works with the free version of Elementor. No Pro license needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:640
msgid "Where is my data stored?"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:644
msgid "All your project data (sections, colors, notes, etc.) is stored in your browser's localStorage. It stays on your device and is never sent to any server. Use the Export -> JSON feature to back it up."
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:650
msgid "Will it slow down my website?"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:654
msgid "Sekkei only loads its scripts inside the Elementor editor - never on your frontend. Your site's load time is completely unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:660
msgid "Can I use it for multiple client projects?"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:664
msgid "Yes. Use the Projects feature inside the tool to create separate workspaces for each client. Each project has its own sections, colors, palette, and notes."
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:670
msgid "How do I back up or move my data?"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/class-itspc-admin.php:674
msgid "Open the tool -> go to the Export tab -> click \"Download JSON\". This saves all your projects. To restore, click \"Import JSON\" on any browser/device."
msgstr ""

